# Copy to .env.local to enable the contact form's in-page submit.
# Create a free form at https://formspree.io, verify the destination
# inbox, and paste its endpoint here (looks like
# https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx). This is a public value baked into
# the static build client-side, so it's fine to commit/expose.
#
# Without it, the contact form falls back to opening the visitor's email
# client via mailto: — nothing breaks, it just skips the in-page submit.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=
